@startuml managed-content-lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #EEEEEE

title Static Platform Content Render (create / deploy)

start

:Installer runs\n(jeeves-tools or jeeves install);

:renderPlatformContent({ version });
note right: Pure: SOUL/AGENTS blocks,\nskills, templates

:Read existing SOUL.md / AGENTS.md;

:upsertPlatformSection(id, existing);

if (Managed block present?) then (yes)
  :Replace block in place\n(owner content kept);
else (no)
  :Strip orphaned BEGIN marker;
  :Insert block at marker position;
endif

:Write files, skills, templates;

stop

note
  Nothing re-runs on a timer.
  Live state: *_status tools.
  Component rules: before_prompt_build
  → appendSystemContext.
end note

@enduml
